  "summary_en": "This prescription lists 6 medicines for Primary Hypothyroidism, Dyslipidemia, and Vitamin D Deficiency. Thyronorm (Levothyroxine) must be taken on an empty stomach every morning. Rosulip (Rosuvastatin) is for cholesterol management. Ecosprin (Aspirin 75mg) is for cardiovascular protection. Calcirol 60K is a weekly Vitamin D supplement. Please take all medicines as directed and attend your follow-up on 2024-11-03.",
